    "preview": "/previews/pq-blog.webp",
    "html": "<div class=\"pq-model\">\n  <section class=\"pq-hero\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-hero-inner\">\n      <div class=\"pq-brand\">\n        <img src=\"/logo-proquelec.svg\" alt=\"PROQUELEC\" class=\"pq-logo\" />\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"pq-eyebrow\">Conseils experts</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-brand-note\">Promotion de la qualit&eacute; et de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; des installations &eacute;lectriques</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-hero-copy\">\n        <h1 class=\"pq-title\">Blog technique</h1>\n        <p class=\"pq-subtitle\">Expliquer les risques et les bonnes pratiques</p>\n        <p class=\"pq-lead\">Des articles p&eacute;dagogiques pour aider les m&eacute;nages, artisans, bureaux d&apos;&eacute;tudes et collectivit&eacute;s &agrave; comprendre les exigences de s&eacute;curit&eacute;.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-actions\">\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pq-button pq-button-primary\">Proposer un sujet</a>\n        <a href=\"/faq\" class=\"pq-button pq-button-secondary\">Consulter la FAQ</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-stats\">\n        \n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">5 min</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Lecture cible</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">4</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Rubriques</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">SN 01-015</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">R&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">PDF</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Ressources li&eacute;es</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-section-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-kicker\">Contenu m&eacute;tier</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-section-title\">Des articles qui servent le terrain</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-text\">Le blog doit traduire les normes et retours d&apos;exp&eacute;rience en recommandations concr&egrave;tes, v&eacute;rifiables et faciles &agrave; appliquer.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pq-grid-2\">\n        \n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Pr&eacute;vention domestique</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Prises qui chauffent, disjonctions, multiprises, humidit&eacute; et comportements &agrave; risque.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Normes expliqu&eacute;es</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Lecture simple des obligations et points de contr&ocirc;le les plus fr&eacute;quents.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Chantiers</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Bonnes pratiques de mise en oeuvre, documentation, essais et r&eacute;ception.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Innovation</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Solaire, domotique, stockage et nouveaux usages &agrave; contr&ocirc;ler.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section pq-section-muted\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container\">\n      <div class=\"pq-section-header\">\n        <p class=\"pq-section-kicker\">Workflow recommand&eacute;</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-section-title\">Parcours op&eacute;rationnel</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-text\">Ces &eacute;tapes donnent au visiteur une logique claire et limitent les demandes incompl&egrave;tes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"pq-steps\">\n        \n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">1</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Identifier un probl&egrave;me</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Partir d&apos;une situation terrain claire.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">2</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Expliquer le risque</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Dire pourquoi le point est important pour la s&eacute;curit&eacute;.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">3</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Donner une action</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Terminer par une v&eacute;rification ou un document &agrave; pr&eacute;parer.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">4</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Relier au service</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Orienter vers contact, diagnostic, formation ou norme.</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-grid-2\">\n      <div class=\"pq-panel\">\n        <h2 class=\"pq-panel-title\">Points &agrave; pr&eacute;parer</h2>\n        <ul class=\"pq-checklist\">\n          \n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Un titre concret, sans jargon inutile.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Une recommandation applicable par le lecteur.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Une limite claire : quand appeler un professionnel.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Un lien vers les ressources officielles ou pages m&eacute;tier.</span>\n        </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pq-result\">\n        <p class=\"pq-result-kicker\">R&eacute;sultat attendu</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-result-title\">Une page plus robuste et plus utile</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-result-text\">Le blog devient un outil de pr&eacute;vention et de conversion vers les services utiles.</p>\n        <p class=\"pq-result-note\">Ce mod&egrave;le est pens&eacute; pour &ecirc;tre coll&eacute; dans le builder, rester lisible sur mobile et conserver une hi&eacute;rarchie claire apr&egrave;s publication.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n"
