    "html": "<div class=\"pq-model\">\n  <section class=\"pq-hero\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-hero-inner\">\n      <div class=\"pq-brand\">\n        <img src=\"/logo-proquelec.svg\" alt=\"PROQUELEC\" class=\"pq-logo\" />\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"pq-eyebrow\">Reconnaissance</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-brand-note\">Promotion de la qualit&eacute; et de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; des installations &eacute;lectriques</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-hero-copy\">\n        <h1 class=\"pq-title\">Labels PROQUELEC</h1>\n        <p class=\"pq-subtitle\">Valoriser les acteurs fiables</p>\n        <p class=\"pq-lead\">Une page pour expliquer les labels, les crit&egrave;res d&apos;attribution, les contr&ocirc;les et les avantages pour les clients.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-actions\">\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pq-button pq-button-primary\">Candidater au label</a>\n        <a href=\"/certifications\" class=\"pq-button pq-button-secondary\">Voir certifications</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pq-stats\">\n        \n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">Charte</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Engagement</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">Audit</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">V&eacute;rification</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">Registre</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Publication</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pq-stat\">\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-value\">Suivi</p>\n          <p class=\"pq-stat-label\">Renouvellement</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-section-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-kicker\">Contenu m&eacute;tier</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-section-title\">Un label doit &ecirc;tre v&eacute;rifiable</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-text\">La valeur du label vient de crit&egrave;res clairs, d&apos;un contr&ocirc;le r&eacute;el et d&apos;une information publique compr&eacute;hensible.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pq-grid-2\">\n        \n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">&Eacute;lectricien confiance</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Reconna&icirc;tre les artisans respectant les r&egrave;gles de s&eacute;curit&eacute; et de documentation.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Entreprise conforme</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Valoriser les organisations capables de produire des dossiers techniques solides.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Mat&eacute;riel recommand&eacute;</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Identifier les produits et &eacute;quipements compatibles avec les exigences de s&eacute;curit&eacute;.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"pq-card pq-card-feature\">\n          <div class=\"pq-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-5\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-card-title\">Partenaire technique</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-card-text\">Qualifier les organismes contribuant aux campagnes, formations ou contr&ocirc;les.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section pq-section-muted\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container\">\n      <div class=\"pq-section-header\">\n        <p class=\"pq-section-kicker\">Workflow recommand&eacute;</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-section-title\">Parcours op&eacute;rationnel</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-section-text\">Ces &eacute;tapes donnent au visiteur une logique claire et limitent les demandes incompl&egrave;tes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"pq-steps\">\n        \n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">1</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Candidature</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">D&eacute;poser les pi&egrave;ces et signer la charte.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">2</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">V&eacute;rification</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Contr&ocirc;ler comp&eacute;tences, r&eacute;f&eacute;rences et pratiques.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">3</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Attribution</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Publier le statut et les conditions d&apos;usage du label.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-step\">\n          <div class=\"pq-step-number\">4</div>\n          <h3 class=\"pq-step-title\">Surveillance</h3>\n          <p class=\"pq-step-text\">Suivre les r&eacute;clamations et renouvellements.</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"pq-section\">\n    <div class=\"pq-layout-container pq-grid-2\">\n      <div class=\"pq-panel\">\n        <h2 class=\"pq-panel-title\">Points &agrave; pr&eacute;parer</h2>\n        <ul class=\"pq-checklist\">\n          \n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Charte sign&eacute;e.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>R&eacute;f&eacute;rences techniques v&eacute;rifiables.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Assurance et documents administratifs.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pq-check-item\">\n          <span class=\"pq-check-icon\">&check;</span>\n          <span>Engagement de mise &agrave; jour annuelle.</span>\n        </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pq-result\">\n        <p class=\"pq-result-kicker\">R&eacute;sultat attendu</p>\n        <h2 class=\"pq-result-title\">Une page plus robuste et plus utile</h2>\n        <p class=\"pq-result-text\">La page donne au public les moyens de comprendre et v&eacute;rifier un label.</p>\n        <p class=\"pq-result-note\">Ce mod&egrave;le est pens&eacute; pour &ecirc;tre coll&eacute; dans le builder, rester lisible sur mobile et conserver une hi&eacute;rarchie claire apr&egrave;s publication.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n"
